<title>USA: Penn National Gaming Inc Q4 net falls.</title>
<headline>Penn National Gaming Inc Q4 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>WYOMISSING, Pa. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>			    Three Months Ended  Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>					December 31,	December 31,</p>
<p>					1996     1995	1996    1995</p>
<p> Total revenues		 $16,360 $13,783   $62,834 $57,676</p>
<p> Total operating expenses    14,137  11,903    53,374  49,421</p>
<p> Income from operations	 2,223   1,880     9,460   8,255</p>
<p>Total other income (expenses)</p>
<p>					(341)	58     (156)     208</p>
<p> Income before income taxes   1,882   1,938     9,304   8,463</p>
<p> Taxes on income		    778     787     3,794   3,467</p>
<p> Net Income			 1,104   1,151     5,510   4,996</p>
<p> Net income per share*	   0.08    0.09	0.39    0.38</p>
<p>Weighted average number of common</p>
<p>   shares outstanding(a)     14,125  12,900    14,019  13,104</p>
<p>(a) Per share results and the weighted average number of shares outstanding have been adjusted to reflect the May 1996 3-for-2 stock split and the December 1996 2-for-1 stock split.</p>
</text>
